---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="flexfetch: your whole system, fetched in milliseconds">
  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
  <header class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="in reveal">
          <p class="eyebrow">Linux + macOS · Pure Rust <s></s></p>
          <h1>Your whole system <em>fetched in milliseconds.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">
            flexfetch is a blazing-fast, themeable system info tool.
            <b>Zero subprocesses, pure Rust.</b> Modules read <code>/proc</code>, sysfs, and macOS APIs directly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="hero-fig reveal">
          <div class="fighd">flexfetch <i>--theme catppuccin-mocha</i><span class="r">cachyos · real output</span></div>
          <div class="plate">
            <img
              src="/flexfetch/terminal-shot.webp"
              alt="flexfetch terminal output on CachyOS with the Catppuccin Mocha theme"
              width="900"
              height="482"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="figcap">
            <b>Real output, real machine.</b> flexfetch on CachyOS with the Catppuccin Mocha theme — every line read
            directly from <b>/proc</b> and the platform APIs. No subprocesses, no text-scraping.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta reveal">
        <div class="go">
          <div class="hd-cmd">
            <code><b>$</b> <span id="cmd-curl">curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh-diwan/flexfetch/main/install.sh | sh</span></code>
            <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="cmd-curl" aria-label="Copy install command">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/flexfetch/docs/quick-start">Quick start</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plat-hint" id="plat-hint"></div>
        <p class="meta">
          MIT licensed · <a href="https://github.com/mahesh-diwan/flexfetch">github.com/mahesh-diwan/flexfetch</a> ·
          <a href="/flexfetch/modules">38 modules</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============ NUMBERS STRIP ============ -->
  <section class="strip" aria-label="flexfetch at a glance">
    <a class="stat" href="/flexfetch/#install">
      <b>1.7 MB</b><span>binary</span>
    </a>
    <a class="stat" href="/flexfetch/modules">
      <b>38</b><span>modules</span>
    </a>
    <a class="stat" href="/flexfetch/modules">
      <b>527</b><span>logos</span>
    </a>
    <a class="stat" href="/flexfetch/#features">
      <b>0</b><span>subprocesses</span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CAPS ROWS ============ -->
  <section class="caps" id="features" aria-label="Features">
    <a class="cap" href="/flexfetch/docs/features">
      <div class="n"><span>01</span></div>
      <div class="cap-text">
        <h3>Zero subprocesses</h3>
        <p>Every module reads kernel data directly — <code>/proc</code>, sysfs, or macOS APIs. No forking, no parsing overhead, no startup cost.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev">
        <div class="ev-row"><span>/proc/meminfo</span><b class="good">direct</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>/proc/cpuinfo</span><b class="good">direct</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>subprocesses</span><b class="acc">0</b></div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="cap" href="/flexfetch/docs/themes">
      <div class="n"><span>02</span></div>
      <div class="cap-text">
        <h3>Themes &amp; gradients</h3>
        <p>Catppuccin, Dracula, Nord, Solarized, Tokyo Night — truecolor everywhere, per-module key/value colors, gradient accents.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev">
        <div class="ev-row"><span>catppuccin</span><i class="swatch" style="background:#b4befe"></i><i class="swatch" style="background:#fab387"></i><i class="swatch" style="background:#a6e3a1"></i></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>dracula</span><i class="swatch" style="background:#bd93f9"></i><i class="swatch" style="background:#50fa7b"></i><i class="swatch" style="background:#8be9fd"></i></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>tokyo night</span><i class="swatch" style="background:#7aa2f7"></i><i class="swatch" style="background:#bb9af7"></i><i class="swatch" style="background:#73daca"></i></div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="cap" href="/flexfetch/docs/features">
      <div class="n"><span>03</span></div>
      <div class="cap-text">
        <h3>ASCII &amp; image logos</h3>
        <p>527 distro logos imported from fastfetch plus hand-tuned first-party art, and PNG/BMP images rendered as block characters with automatic palette extraction.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev">
        <div class="ev-row"><span>fastfetch imports</span><b class="good">527</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>custom logos</span><b class="good">first-party</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>image → block art</span><b>png/bmp</b></div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="cap" href="/flexfetch/docs/features">
      <div class="n"><span>04</span></div>
      <div class="cap-text">
        <h3>Live TUI dashboard</h3>
        <p><code>flexfetch --live</code> opens a TUI with CPU, memory, and disk gauges, per-process bars, and network sparklines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev">
        <div class="ev-row"><span>cpu</span><span class="ev-bar"><i style="width:62%"></i></span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>memory</span><span class="ev-bar"><i style="width:48%"></i></span></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>network</span><span class="ev-bar"><i style="width:74%"></i></span></div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="cap" href="/flexfetch/docs/templates">
      <div class="n"><span>05</span></div>
      <div class="cap-text">
        <h3>Templates &amp; exports</h3>
        <p>Tera templates with loops and conditionals for full layout control, plus exports to SVG, PNG, HTML, Markdown, CSV, and Prometheus.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev">
        <div class="ev-row"><span>tera templates</span><b class="good">supported</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>svg / png / html</span><b>export</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>csv / prometheus</span><b>export</b></div>
      </div>
    </a>
    <a class="cap" href="/flexfetch/docs/features">
      <div class="n"><span>06</span></div>
      <div class="cap-text">
        <h3>Custom modules &amp; context</h3>
        <p>Define your own info sources in config, and smart fetch layers git, project type, container and SSH context from your working directory.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ev">
        <div class="ev-row"><span>[custom] modules</span><b class="good">config</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>smart context</span><b class="good">git/project</b></div>
        <div class="ev-row"><span>health score</span><b class="acc">0-100</b></div>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ INSTALL ============ -->
  <section class="section" id="install">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head reveal">
        <h2>On your machine in one command.</h2>
        <p>Releases ship Linux (musl static, 3 arches) and macOS (arm64 + x86_64) binaries. Every artifact ships checksums and signatures for verification.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="inst-grid">
        <div class="inst reveal">
          <div class="inst-head">
            <span class="badge">official</span>
            <h3>curl installer</h3>
            <p>Detects your platform, verifies the checksum before unpacking, and refuses to install anything if the file doesn't match.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="code-block">
            <div class="code-tabs">
              <span class="code-tab active">install</span>
            </div>
            <div class="code-body">
              <code id="cmd-curl2">curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mahesh-diwan/flexfetch/main/install.sh | sh</code>
              <button class="copy-btn" data-copy="cmd-curl2" aria-label="Copy install command">Copy</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="plat-hint" id="plat-hint2"></div>
          <div class="note">Linux &amp; macOS · checksum + signature verified</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="secure-strip reveal">
        <span class="ok">SHA-256 checksums</span>
        <span class="ok">cosign signatures</span>
        <span class="ok">supply-chain provenance</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ CLOSING ============ -->
  <section class="closing">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="reveal">Ship a faster <em>neofetch.</em></h2>
      <div class="go reveal">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/flexfetch/#install">Install flexfetch</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/mahesh-diwan/flexfetch">Star on GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
